--- expect
error E_SYNTAX at 1:3
===
### name: lim.deep-copy-is-independent
--- note
Assignment copies by value all the way down, so no two variables share structure.
--- source
A[1]["x"] = 1; B = A; B[1]["x"] = 9; A[1]["x"]
--- expect
num 1
===
### name: lim.interp-applies-scalar-context-to-list
--- note
Interpolation lowers to `&`, so it applies scalar context — a list yields its
first element rather than the list.
--- source
"{(7, 8)}"
--- expect
text "7"
===
